    <DisplayName>ST Syntax Formatter 1.7.0</DisplayName>
    <Description xml:space="preserve">TwinCAT3 Structured Text (ST) code formatter for Visual Studio. Supports IEC 61131-3 with TwinCAT3 OOP extensions, attributes, and pragmas.</Description>
